{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06643","headline":"贻从军行 · 储光羲","name":"贻从军行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"取胜小非用，来朝明光殿，东平不足先。\n梦出凤林间，梦还沧海阙。\n万里尽阴色，岂爲我离别。\n马上吹笛起寒风，道傍舞劒飞春雪。\n男儿悬弧非一日，君去成高节。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06643.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06643","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}